# Ooma

> Ooma provides business communications solutions for organizations of all sizes, from small and midsize businesses to large enterprises. Solutions include business phone systems, UCaaS, AI-powered call management, business internet, and POTS replacement with Ooma AirDial, along with residential VoIP and purpose-built home phone products such as MyPhone and StarDial.

